Job Details: Job Number = S001909/I, Parent Table Code = JJ, Parent ID = {trnJob.JH_ParentID}, Parent Type = Enterprise.Freight.LocalCartage.Business.CommonCartage, Job Type = TRN, Job Status = WRK, Parent Job = ()
JobNumber details:
CartageParent is NOT null.
JJ_Status = v2.
UniqueConsignmentID = S001909.
JJ_ConsignmentID = S001910/I. Original value is: S001909/I."), ErrorReporter.LastMessageReported);
